    Bug 2061119 - Improve the Gloda results page layout resizing. r=tobyp,arschmitz

    - Use the global search field to search for something
    - The Gloda results body content (right column) should resize to a max of 900px
    - Resizing the page should shrink the content
    - If the Today Pane is visible, the content should adapt and not overlap
    - The "sort" select shows the chevron icon

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316870

